s its first consumer, including the fast-path verb [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]classification fix that read-only `dep` subcommands need.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove a dependency edge as a recorded event[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]remove[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]remove: add the `dependency_removed` event, its replay rules, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`remove_dependencies` mutation in the Rust core, expose them through the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding and `sase bead dep rm`, and stop the SQLite mirror from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resurrecting a removed edge.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Walk the blocking graph in either direction[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tree[dim] · [dim][/dim]after graph[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tree: render the dependency graph as a tree over the adapter, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycle, repeat-subtree, depth-truncation, and unresolved-target markers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus a footer that names the longest blocking chain.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Land the three verbs as one documented contract[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after remove, tree[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: reconcile the docs, the generated skill, and `bead onboard` around[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the finished verb, bump the published core version window, and produce [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance evidence against the live store.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a3","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-a3.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a8d7fd220e12ef14b720e70ae2d01442","started_at":"2026-07-27T13:46:54.716028","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785179182,"sha":"793887cf80f9e5491e4cd227682a344c4aece8ae","subject":"feat(bead): add dependency tree command (sase-a3.3)"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-07-27T15:07:56.260388","files":{"chat":{"digest":"6f930ea58b32d8cc873b66bf34642e52174283b3e61b10ad75f812f7e2f55a36","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3/chat.md","size_bytes":9000},"commits":{"digest":"e0602cff490ac32239b39cd7aa959ac9fee5dd068ace03e80df1ef0daf99d768","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3/commits.json","size_bytes":229},"meta":{"digest":"2fd14d4bf8e264312d28353443cbd9b9261e33700426dcf610730ce9ea1ea05a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3/meta.json","size_bytes":558},"state":{"digest":"6720fd1f24cf37504b4f55f6968afcc8deba78cab05a81e5de957438ca1735df","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-07-27T15:07:56.260388","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3","local_name":"sase-a3.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-a3","agent_clan_generation":"20260727134633","approve":true,"cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a3","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-a3.3","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ccd7f3a5b1a19f3614a73bcb0581db0b","started_at":"2026-07-27T14:34:29.809566","state":"dismissed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-a3.land"]}
